-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 0.1.0 (2026-11-02)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * First release (ORDER 350): the session's side of sparky-stereo-problems, one notifier for every package of
    the edition. At login one notification per open problem, or one summary when several are open; then one for
    each new or changed problem; a failed problem is Critical and stays, a degraded one or a notice is Normal
  * Each problem offers Show details (its evidence: the command, its exit status, its output, the repair and the
    last repair), Repair (through pkexec for the machine's and this boot's problems), the record's own actions and
    Hide, which is the person's and comes back when the problem changes or a repair fails
  * One notifyrc (sparky-stereo-problems.notifyrc), so System Settings' Notifications page lists every event;
    the strings in the nine required languages
